	<div class='left-menu-header'><a href='//www.sos.mo.gov/library'>State Library</a></div><br /><a href='//www.sos.mo.gov/library'><img src='//www.sos.mo.gov/cmsImages/IT/Public/LibraryMedium.png' width='94' height='94' alt='State Library' /></a><br /><p><a href='/library/reference/orders/default'>Governor's Executive Orders</a></p><p><a href='https://mostate.libguides.com/reference/modocs'>Missouri Government Publications</a></p><p><a href='https://mostate.libguides.com/reference/'>Reference Services</a></p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p><br/><div class='div-info'><a href='//www.sos.mo.gov/library'><img src='//www.sos.mo.gov/cmsImages/IT/Public/LibrarySmall.png' width='46' height='46' alt='State Library' /></a><br /><a href='//www.sos.mo.gov/library'>State Library</a><br /><a href='https://mostate.libguides.com/reference'>Reference Services</a><hr class='div-line' />Phone: (573) 751-3615 <br />E-Mail: <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#127e7b7060777452617d613c7f7d3c757d64"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="c2aeaba0b0a7a482b1adb1ecafadeca5adb4">[email&#160;protected]</span></a><hr class='div-line' /></div>
